{
  "帮我优化主界面布局，让任务详情成为主体，左侧任务列表保持简洁。": "Make task details the focus of the dashboard. Keep the navigation and task list compact so conversations have more room.",
  "我会把左侧导航和任务列表收窄，右侧用于阅读对话。运行状态、耗时和活动时间线可以在「监控详情」中查看。\\n\\n正在检查现有界面的布局与数据来源。": "I will narrow the navigation and task list, leaving the main pane for the conversation. The Monitor tab will show task status, elapsed time, and the activity timeline.\\n\\nReviewing the current layout and local data sources.",
  "布局调整已完成，正在等待授权执行验证。\\n\\n当前已支持：\\n• 按时间查看各工具的最近任务\\n• 直接阅读用户提问与 AI 回复\\n• 在监控详情中查看任务的实时状态": "The layout changes are ready. Waiting for approval to run validation.\\n\\nYou can now:\\n• Browse recent tasks across agents in time order\\n• Read prompts and AI replies in one place\\n• Inspect live activity in the Monitor tab",
  "合并各工具可读取的本地记录，最多保留 30 天 / 500 条。活动记录不代表任务已经完成。": "Local records across agents. Up to 30 days / 500 tasks. Activity alone does not imply completion.",
  "Codex 自动读取本轮状态；Claude Code 可在设置 → Agent 中启用。其他工具继续记录用量。": "Codex reads local task events. Enable Claude Code hooks in Settings. Other tools continue tracking usage.",
  "只读本地对话 · 自动更新 · 不另存正文": "Local, read-only · Auto-refresh · No transcript copies",
